# Enterprise Motion Standard (SoT)

**CSS-first** cho micro-interaction ổn định; **Motion (`motion/react`)** + **GSAP** chỉ trong lớp `client/src/motion/` (primitives / hooks). Feature pages **compose** token/class/primitive — **không** import `motion/react`, `gsap`, hay invent `@keyframes` / duration / easing ad-hoc.

Chi tiết: `client/src/motion/catalog.js`, `tokens.js`, `transitions.js`, `classes.js`, `primitives/*`, `client/src/index.css`. QA: `/dev/motion-lab`.

## Engines (phân vai)

| Layer | Dùng cho | Import từ |
|-------|----------|-----------|
| CSS `vh-motion-*` / `vh-presence-*` | Hover, press fallback, overlay presence, nav collapse, skeleton | `classes.js` |
| Motion | Button/field, page/tab, fetch bar, scroll progress, query fade | primitives + `MotionProvider` |
| GSAP | List reveal, scroll reveal (ScrollTrigger), field invalid pulse | `useGsapReveal`, `useScrollReveal`, `gsapFieldInvalidPulse` |

Cấm: package `framer-motion`; gọi `gsap`/`motion` thẳng trong `features/**` (trừ re-export primitive).

## Catalog bề mặt (tóm tắt)

| Nhóm | Surfaces | Status mục tiêu |
|------|----------|-----------------|
| Micro | button, textField, rowHover, cardHover | ready |
| Nav | pageRoute, tabPanel, tabIndicator, navCollapse | ready |
| Overlay | modal, drawer, popover, toast | ready (MotionPresence) |
| Async | pageLoader, skeleton, fetchBar, inlineBusy, queryState, listReveal | ready |
| Scroll | scrollReveal, scrollProgress | ready |
| Domain | waveform, boardDnd | planned (ngoài SoT general) |

Nguồn SoT đầy đủ: `MOTION_SURFACE` trong `catalog.js`.

## Tokens (khóa)

| Token | Giá trị | Dùng cho |
|-------|---------|----------|
| `--vh-motion-fast` / `VH_MOTION_FAST_MS` | 100ms | hover color, row, fetch fade |
| `--vh-motion-base` / `VH_MOTION_BASE_MS` | 150ms | button, input, tab, page, query |
| `--vh-motion-slow` / `VH_MOTION_SLOW_MS` | 220ms | modal/drawer enter-exit |
| `--vh-motion-press` | 80ms | press scale |
| Ease | Material standard + Motion bezier tuples | không bounce/spring mạnh |
| Distance | 4px Y / 8px X / scale 0.97·1.01 | fade-up / slide / press |

## Map action → pattern

| Action | Pattern | Primitive |
|--------|---------|-----------|
| Click CTA | color + scale 0.97 | `MotionButton` |
| Text field | focus + invalid pulse | `MotionTextField` |
| Route change | fade/slide 150ms | `PageMotion` (Suite + Admin shell) |
| Tab change | indicator `layoutId` + panel fade | `TabIndicator` + `TabPanelMotion` |
| Hover row/card | bg / lift 2px | `VH_MOTION_ROW` / `VH_MOTION_CARD` |
| List mount | stagger fade-up | `useGsapReveal` |
| Scroll into view | once fade-up | `useScrollReveal` |
| Scroll reading | top scaleX | `ScrollProgressBar` |
| Page Suspense | brand spinner | `BrandPageLoader` |
| Query loading | skeleton lines | `SkeletonBlock` / `QueryStateView` |
| Background fetch | top indeterminate bar | `FetchBar` (`isFetching`) |
| Button busy | spinner | `InlineBusy` / `VH_MOTION_SPINNER` |
| Modal/Drawer/Popover | Motion enter/exit 220ms | `MotionPresence` + `overlayMotion` |
| Toast | slide + fade | `Toast` + `motionToast` |
| Nav accordion | grid-rows | `NavCollapse` |


## Presence (overlay)

```text
isOpen true  → mounted=true, phase=enter
isOpen false → phase=exit → sau duration (reduce=0) → mounted=false
```

## Cấm

- `transition: all` mới; bounce / `hover:scale-105` / spring marketing.
- Animate `width`/`height` layout thrash — ưu tiên opacity + transform.
- Scroll scrub/parallax marketing trên app shell.
- Invent keyframes feature khi đã có token (trừ waveform / board DnD).

## Reduced motion

- CSS: `vh-motion-respect` + `motion-reduce:*`
- Motion: `MotionProvider` → `reducedMotion="user"`
- GSAP: `matchMedia` + `resolveMotionDuration(..., reduced)`

